| ts                      | nested |
+-------------------------+--------+
| 1970-01-01T00:00:00.001 | 2      |
| 1970-01-01T00:00:00.002 | 4      |
| 1970-01-01T00:00:00.003 |        |
| 1970-01-01T00:00:00.004 |        |
| 1970-01-01T00:00:00.005 |        |
+-------------------------+--------+

